exports[`render > writes GitHub Markdown with escaped table cells 1`] = `
"# podexit report

CocoaPods trunk goes read-only on **2026-12-02**, after a trial run from 2026-11-01 to 2026-11-07 ([announcement](https://blog.cocoapods.org/CocoaPods-Specs-Repo/)). Builds keep working: pods already on trunk stay installable after December 2, 2026. Trunk only stops accepting new versions.

## \`ios/Podfile.lock\`

Flutter app, 7 pods, 5 in the Podfile.

- 3 frozen on trunk · 3 capped by the publisher · 1 not affected
- 3 pods with a Swift package · 1 without · 2 unknown
- Guide: [Flutter apps and plugins](https://github.com/muhittincamdali/podexit/blob/main/docs/guides/flutter.md)

| Pod | Locked | Latest on trunk | Updates | Swift package | Pulled in by |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| \`FirebaseAnalytics\` | \`11.15.0\` |  | capped at 12.x | [yes (Firebase)](https://github.com/firebase/firebase-ios-sdk) |  |
| \`FirebaseCore\` | \`11.15.0\` |  | capped at 12.x | [yes (Firebase)](https://github.com/firebase/firebase-ios-sdk) | \`FirebaseAnalytics\` |
| \`nanopb\` | \`3.30910.0\` |  | capped with Firebase | unknown | \`FirebaseCore\` |
| \`Alamofire\` | \`5.9.1\` | \`5.12.2\` (2026-09-10) | frozen after Dec 2 | [yes](https://github.com/Alamofire/Alamofire) |  |
| \`Pipe\\|Pod\` | \`1.0.0\` |  | frozen after Dec 2 | unknown |  |
| \`Stale\` | \`0.4.0\` |  | frozen after Dec 2 | [no](https://github.com/acme/Stale) |  |

